{"type":"queue-operation","operation":"enqueue","timestamp":"2026-08-31T12:11:29.695Z","sessionId":"55398c64-7c65-40db-9b68-886111a86d7f","content":"I already asked you to launch the UI and check things yourself. Why aren't you doing that, man? Why are you asking me for trivial things like UI changes? I should be giving you critical platform-level, architectural-level changes, telling you those kinds of things, rather than telling you the button looks off, the UI is not complete, or the dark mode doesn't work. These are a waste of my time. You need to understand: I can't be investing my time in telling you all this. These are the things you need to invest your time on.\n\nMaybe a new UI kind of feature, maybe I can give you that, but these basic issues, you are not a very junior kind of developer. You need to be an expert in UI as well as frontend, and you need to check it yourself. You need to solve it rather than making me invest my time in this one. Add it to Claude.md. I am being very, very serious about it. I don't want to waste my time fixing UI bugs or detecting UI bugs."}
